<title>JAPAN: DKB to announce 96/97 earnings forecast revision.</title>
<headline>DKB to announce 96/97 earnings forecast revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd (DKB) said on Friday that it would announce a revision in its earnings forecast for the year to March 31, at 3.40 p.m. (0640 GMT).</p>
